```c
static int
mpz_init_set_str(mrb_state *mrb, mpz_t *x, const char *s, mrb_int len, mrb_int base)
{
  size_t i;
  ...
  for (i = len-1;; i--) {
    if (s[i]=='_') continue;
    ...
  }
```

The issue: `i` is `size_t` (unsigned). If `len` is 0, then `i = len-1 = (size_t)-1` which is a huge number, causing out-of-bounds read `s[i]`.

